9. My findings on the above issues are as follows:
Issue No.1 : In the Negative Issue No. 2 : Does not survive for consideration Issue No.3 : As per final order, for the following;
REASONS 10. Issue No.1 : - In order to explain the actionable negligence of the driver of the alleged offending vehicle, P.W.1 has filed his affidavit explaining the vivid picture of the accident that took place on 24-06-2024, at about 09-30 A.M., when the petitioner was riding his motorcycle bearing Reg.No.AP-26-AQ-1324 on Chowdepalle-Palamaner road and when he reached infront of Cricket Ground, near Dadepalle village, Chittoor, A.P, at that time the driver of JCB bearing Reg.No.AP-39-GH-6457 (hereinafter referred to as the offending vehicle) came from opposite direction in a rash and negligent manner and dashed against the petitioner's motorcycle, result of which he fell down and sustained grievous injuries.
